installed provenance-kit 1.0.0 (installable) from its package, 3 files, each one's size and sha256 as lamp-skill.json says; it carries no signature: a package installed by hand from a file. It may use: speak. A running lamp-skills loads it within 2 s. The skills here give the model 1 function (fixture_provenance). A session takes 32, the voice's own and the actions part's first (30 on a product lamp), and past 32 the last are dropped unless the voice runs with LAMP_USE_SKILL=on (every skill through one function, use_skill).
